OL,3,GNEWSA'Smoking took years away from my
OL,4,Adad and me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Katie Freeman recalls memories of
OL,7,Fher late father, he is rarely without a
OL,8,Fcigarette in hand.
OL,10,FNigel Freeman smoked for most of his
OL,11,Flife and died at the age of 74 from
OL,12,Fsmoking-related chronic obstructive
OL,13,Fpulmonary disease (COPD), which
OL,14,Fimpacted his lungs.
OL,16,F"Some of my earliest memories of
OL,17,Fsmoking are probably of him having a
OL,18,Fpipe," Katie, from Swindon in
OL,19,FWiltshire, said. "Of an ashtray being
OL,20,Fin the house, of dad smoking in the
OL,21,Fcar."
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
