OL,3,GNEWSA'Smoking took years away from my
OL,4,Adad and me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie, 47, is sharing her father's
OL,7,Fstory as part of Smokefree South West's
OL,8,FWhat Will You Miss? campaign, which
OL,9,Fmarks 100 days until the UK's smoking
OL,10,Fban for those born after 2008 comes
OL,11,Finto effect on 1 January.
